        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Anaa ranv guang the, Nang lung daeng khou,",
            "Guloumeipu, ata zay tuanclou o,",
            "Ata pamclou o, Nang ngaengv gay khou,",
            "Tingkauh zaengthaek khou",
            "tiizaeng ’thaekclou o. (2)",
            "",
            "2 Anaa ranv guang the, pumtang guang de,",
            "AGuangc Jisu khang kaipat",
            "phungc guang mak;",
            "Alung laic patmei na phungc guang e;",
            "Nang zei 1<~ <~1 ata sw ’thanlou o. (2)",
            "",
            "3 Anaa ranv guang the, Nang mei sw khang,",
            "Paapc raap taanv guay karaengna ’patlou the,",
            "Paapc tuang neihlaa guay nic ’patlou the;",
            "Jisu na ta akhang tiiswlou o. (2)",
            "",
            "4 Anaa ranv bam ni, panty nai saanv,",
            "Tingkauh thangc ai gayna guang tangh mak saanv;",
            "Kanganv nai dat makna",
            "tiingsaengzaeng",
            "Guloumeipu, Nang khou ’naa ranv bam ni. (2)"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
